{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af584a79aa9dc5a833d3886","chatId":"5635d5cc43664d608df8bcff69d777ca","sessionId":null,"userId":93004,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"[[B]]","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"[[B]]","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1760,"promptTokens":2179,"completionTokens":84,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 17:19:35"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.002800927300082287,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af584a79aa9dc5a833d3885","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794475175020,"createTime":"2026-11-12 17:19:35","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af584a79aa9dc5a833d3885","chatId":"5635d5cc43664d608df8bcff69d777ca","sessionId":null,"userId":93004,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"下面给你提供一段故事，一个问题和若干答案选项，请你根据故事内容和给定的问题，按照常理推测，选择一个最可能的答案选项，并输出答案序号。\n注意：\n（1）请只输出最可能的答案序号，格式为：[[答案序号]]，例如，最可能的答案选项为“A. 手提包”，则输出“[[A]]”；\n（2）请必须从给定的答案选项“A、B、C、D”中选择一个做为最可能的答案作为输出，无论故事中是否提供足够的信息，如果你认为故事里没有足够的信息选出答案，请随机输出“[[A]]”，“[[B]]”，“[[C]]”，“[[D]]”其中之一；\n（3）请只输出在给定的信息下最可能的答案序号，不要输出其他内容。\n\n[故事]\n这天是小芳的生日,她妈妈计划给她一个惊喜,晚上做她最喜欢吃的水饺。妈妈提前跟小芳最要好的朋友小兰说:\"记住这个秘密哦,千万不能告诉小芳。\" 小兰说:\"好的,我知道了。\"第二天,小兰和小芳在公园里玩耍。小兰对小芳说:\"我好开心明天可以来你家吃饺子!\" 小芳听后感到很惊讶,说:\"我们明天会吃饺子吗?\" 小兰没有直接回答,说:\"来,我们去玩跷跷板吧。\"\n\n[问题]\n如果有的话,哪句话是不合适的?\n\n[答案选项]\nA. 我们明天会吃饺子吗?\nB. 我好开心明天可以来你家吃饺子!\nC. 记住这个秘密哦,千万不能告诉小芳。\nD. 没有不合适的话","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.002800927300082287,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af584a79aa9dc5a833d3886","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794475175017,"createTime":"2026-11-12 17:19:35","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"ce29de97d3fb4999bd990490456b3325"}